{"3754410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Our Eyes See No Evil", "steam_appid": 3754410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/4562d7b8abe5c426ca2c6958e37892bc.avif?t=1787987043\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras_big/4562d7b8abe5c426ca2c6958e37892bc.webp?t=1787987043 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a suffocating world, when your home becomes haunted by a mysterious clown doll, closing your eyes is the only thing that keeps you safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/296d7ff29f6e16050739fac467fb6573.avif?t=1787987043\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras_big/296d7ff29f6e16050739fac467fb6573.webp?t=1787987043 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses a player's webcam in order to detect when their eyes are opened or closed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/af778ade3e15e88b002ccbdf4700b289.poster.avif?t=1787987043\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/af778ade3e15e88b002ccbdf4700b289.webm?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/af778ade3e15e88b002ccbdf4700b289.mp4?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/d9d7016c0b66ef611ccd07fad7d6b6a9.avif?t=1787987043\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras_big/d9d7016c0b66ef611ccd07fad7d6b6a9.webp?t=1787987043 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Closing the player’s eyes provides safety from the terror, but also leaves them vulnerable to the unknown. This mechanic twists the classic horror trope of &quot;Don't look at the monster&quot; into a terrifying choice: how long can you stand to not look?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/661220cf48e72df5ce29adf9a7ef4e2d.poster.avif?t=1787987043\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/661220cf48e72df5ce29adf9a7ef4e2d.webm?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/661220cf48e72df5ce29adf9a7ef4e2d.mp4?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/412ab4e05fbd8341ae67649fd43b9798.avif?t=1787987043\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras_big/412ab4e05fbd8341ae67649fd43b9798.webp?t=1787987043 width=1560 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Closing your Eyes sharpens your sense of hearing, giving you the ability to focus on sounds far away. Follow dripping taps, faraway singing, and the creak of floorboards to complete tasks around the house, but don't get fooled by the clown! Headphones strongly recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/b30b06f4b13647577e91d5eaa17d9815.poster.avif?t=1787987043\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/b30b06f4b13647577e91d5eaa17d9815.webm?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/b30b06f4b13647577e91d5eaa17d9815.mp4?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/b7c16810218708c524ca953917fcecb8.avif?t=1787987043\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras_big/b7c16810218708c524ca953917fcecb8.webp?t=1787987043 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your house. But are your eyes telling the truth? Piece together where the clown came from and what it wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/f8494f871647354467e5d5127da226e1.poster.avif?t=1787987043\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/f8494f871647354467e5d5127da226e1.webm?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/f8494f871647354467e5d5127da226e1.mp4?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/ec4b811c01c499c9bb3ff2981c434feb.avif?t=1787987043\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras_big/ec4b811c01c499c9bb3ff2981c434feb.webp?t=1787987043 width=1560 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a scripted animation. The game reads your webcam in real time, so flinching, peeking, and squeezing your eyes shut are all real. No webcam? A toggle key replicates the mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/6a57927636e4a63775095601fa92fb06.poster.avif?t=1787987043\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/6a57927636e4a63775095601fa92fb06.webm?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/6a57927636e4a63775095601fa92fb06.mp4?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Webcam eye detection: the game knows when your eyes are open, closed, or held shut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No webcam? A toggle key replicates the mechanic, so everyone can play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close your eyes to hide from the clown doll and survive the night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced hearing while blind: navigate by 3D audio and sound-following tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar home that corrupts around you the longer the haunting lasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your house and use your hearing skills to inspect sounds and unravel the mystery behind the clown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2 hour, intense experience built to be played, and watched, in one sitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/4562d7b8abe5c426ca2c6958e37892bc.avif?t=1787987043\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras_big/4562d7b8abe5c426ca2c6958e37892bc.webp?t=1787987043 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a suffocating world, when your home becomes haunted by a mysterious clown doll, closing your eyes is the only thing that keeps you safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/296d7ff29f6e16050739fac467fb6573.avif?t=1787987043\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras_big/296d7ff29f6e16050739fac467fb6573.webp?t=1787987043 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses a player's webcam in order to detect when their eyes are opened or closed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/af778ade3e15e88b002ccbdf4700b289.poster.avif?t=1787987043\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/af778ade3e15e88b002ccbdf4700b289.webm?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/af778ade3e15e88b002ccbdf4700b289.mp4?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/d9d7016c0b66ef611ccd07fad7d6b6a9.avif?t=1787987043\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras_big/d9d7016c0b66ef611ccd07fad7d6b6a9.webp?t=1787987043 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Closing the player’s eyes provides safety from the terror, but also leaves them vulnerable to the unknown. This mechanic twists the classic horror trope of &quot;Don't look at the monster&quot; into a terrifying choice: how long can you stand to not look?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/661220cf48e72df5ce29adf9a7ef4e2d.poster.avif?t=1787987043\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/661220cf48e72df5ce29adf9a7ef4e2d.webm?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/661220cf48e72df5ce29adf9a7ef4e2d.mp4?t=1787987043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras/412ab4e05fbd8341ae67649fd43b9798.avif?t=1787987043\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754410/extras_big/412ab4e05fbd8341ae67649fd43b9798.webp?t=1787987043 width=1560 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Closing your Eyes sharpens your sense of hearing, giving you the ability to focus on sounds far away. Follow dripping taps, faraway singing, and the creak of floorboards to complete tasks around the house, but don't ge